OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with cloud thickening and
OL,7,Flowering. Overcast with low cloud
OL,8,Fovernight and a few spots of light
OL,9,Frain possible. Strong southeasterly
OL,10,Fwinds with gales or severe gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy morning with rain,
OL,13,Fheavy at times, spreading
OL,14,Fnortheastwards and clearing Orkney by
OL,15,Fthe afternoon and Shetland in the
OL,16,Fevening. Strong southeasterly winds
OL,17,Fwith gale risk diminishing through the
OL,18,Fday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
