OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry Thursday with the odd
OL,7,Fshower possible and sunny spells.
OL,8,FCloudy on Friday with rain spreading
OL,9,Feastwards. Variable cloud with rain or
OL,10,Fshowers on Saturday. Breezy at times.
